<title>USA: RVM FY 97 $0.19/shr profit vs $0.45 loss.</title>
<headline>RVM FY 97 $0.19/shr profit vs $0.45 loss.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Years ended March 31</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.19     loss	 $0.45</p>
<p> Net     profit	     377     loss	   866</p>
<p> Revs			61,638		   61,794</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,938		    1,944</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The net income and earnings per share figures are proforma.</p>
<p>The company's full name is RVM Industries Inc. RVM was formed March 31 when Ravens Metal Products Inc changed its name to Ravens Inc and set up RVM Industries Inc as a holding company. It then bought Albex Aluminum Inc and Signs and Blank Inc.</p>
<p>The consolidated financial statement reflect the combined businesses on an &quot;as if pooling of interests&quot; basis, the company said. An overview of selcted fininacial data of the business segments follows.</p>
<p>							1997	     1996</p>
<p>Ravens Inc</p>
<p>    sales to customers		  $41,652,421    $40,238,755</p>
<p>    capital expenditures		    372,225	1,588,445</p>
